#What effect does blessing/cursing have over items other than weapons
#or rings?
Well on potions and scrolls it will give you some very good/bad changes
to the usual effect of the item.ie a blessed scroll of punishment will
not give you the ball&chain while a cursed scroll of genocide will call
a large no of the monsters that you're trying to genocide.

#I keep hearing about a trick that converts potions of water in holy
#water (I haven't found either yet and I'm level 14, got to dungeon level
#50 and am working my way up).  How is that done?  I have played at
#least three earlier versions of Nethack, and in all of those I acquired
#a much larger variety of items much earlier in the game.  Is this a
#bug?
The trick of creating holy water is to find an altar of good alignment
and drop your potions of water on it.The potions will flash/glow amber I
think creating holy water.This will also work for removing curses on some
items.The altars will not work indefinitely though.

#One last question: when monsters curse at you, does that automatically
#mean an item in your inventory gets cursed?
My experience with this is that low level monsters that curse you do not
automatically succeed in doing so and it is only the higher level monsters
like Lich's that will nearly always succeed.

